  "content_id": "16136221",
  "title": "Osmosis OSMO Network Fees",
  "description": "Osmosis (OSMO) Network – DeFi for Cosmos\nOsmosis is a DEX-focused blockchain built from Cosmos tech, optimized for low fees and DeFi.\nHow ...",
  "body": "<h1 id=\"h_01JSZ4FBS2KADHVRW441NKZHZ1\">Osmosis (OSMO) Network – DeFi for Cosmos</h1><p class=\"no-margin\">Osmosis is a DEX-focused blockchain built from Cosmos tech, optimized for low fees and DeFi.</p><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ4FBS2SRA48RMEXJ2EBDW3\">How OSMO Fees Work</h2><ul><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Gas price</b> in <b>OSMO</b></p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Network congestion</b> impacts minor adjustments.</p></li></ul><p class=\"no-margin\">Edge dynamically picks the best rate for you.</p><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ4FBS2CF40PQMZP8NZMR2J\">Fee Options Available</h2><ul><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>High</b></p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Optimal (default)</b></p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Low</b></p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Custom</b></p></li></ul><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ4FBS2FENNTNEY3ZJTWFC9\">Average Cost</h2><p class=\"no-margin\">Around <b>$0.002 to $0.01 USD</b> per transaction.</p><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ4FBS2FCCFVTTCRPY4Y756\">Why It Matters</h2><p class=\"no-margin\">Low fees make Osmosis perfect for frequent swaps and DeFi moves. Edge keeps it efficient and affordable.</p>",
